  "note": "Triennial election of the Donaghadee Urban District Council (North Ward four seats, South Ward five), polling day 17 May 1967. No contest in either ward: eight nominations for nine seats, so one North Ward seat was left to be filled by co-option. Five candidates for five seats. Returned unopposed."
